1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,540
Where are you going this Saturday?

2
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:04,970
I'm leaving.

3
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:08,860
Getting away for the night.

4
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:15,100
No, I'm going, I'm gonna drive down to the Bay Area to go see Big Bang.

5
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:15,670
how did it

6
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:21,010
well it was when the new song came out for some reason i looked up

7
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:23,590
i knew they were going on a world tour but i didn't really know where

8
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:27,840
i had seen kind of stuff of them starting in Korea

9
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:32,990
And I just happened to look like, oh, it'd be interesting to see where they're going in the U.S.

10
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:40,100
And it turned out they're only going to two cities, Oakland and New Jersey, somewhere in New Jersey. I don't know where.

11
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,500
And Oakland's not far from here.

12
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:46,460
And that's two of the three U.S. dates are in Oakland.

13
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:49,760
So then it's like, oh, I should go!

14
00:00:50,390 --> 00:00:55,980
So obviously, Jaemyun can't go with me because someone has to watch the kids.

15
00:00:55,980 --> 00:01:00,660
So I thought it was pretty unlikely that I would get to go and find someone.

16
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:01,950
I didn't want to go by myself.

17
00:01:01,950 --> 00:01:04,990
So trying to find someone to go, you know,

18
00:01:04,990 --> 00:01:07,940
I do have friends who listen to Korean music, but not much.

19
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:12,510
But anyways, I decided to ask my cousin if she wanted to go.

20
00:01:12,510 --> 00:01:28,250
And I don't know if she knows anything about them, if she's ever heard any of their music. If she's ever listened to Kpop, other than like Kpop demon hunters, maybe. Or, you know, hearing BTS.

21
00:01:28,250 --> 00:01:33,020
