48
00:03:33,820 --> 00:03:36,220
I feel like Fantastic Baby.

49
00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:38,750
I don't know what year that came out,

50
00:03:38,750 --> 00:03:49,730
but... it was still pretty popular like playing Like, you'd hear it on the radio or places were playing it a lot.

51
00:03:49,730 --> 00:03:55,170
So I feel like somehow through that, I started to like it a lot and listening to it.

52
00:03:55,170 --> 00:04:03,650
And then when we met, I feel like you had told me stories of, like, you dancing to it in Hong Kong and stuff like that. I don't know.

53
00:04:03,650 --> 00:04:06,800
And then it just, it was fun groups,

54
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:16,190
and when they had their last concert in korea before going into the military service we went and got tickets and went

55
00:04:16,190 --> 00:04:19,430
and you got really mad at me for spending so much money

56
00:04:19,430 --> 00:04:21,590
how much was it? it was a lot

57
00:04:21,590 --> 00:04:28,320
i think i spent it was probably $500 in total for our two tickets i think

58
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:31,300
if..  i think it was around there

59
00:04:31,300 --> 00:04:33,600
i think they were like two three hundred each or something

60
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:37,230
They were also nosebleed seats,

61
00:04:37,230 --> 00:04:44,930
but you had just had surgery a couple weeks, maybe a month before on your knees.

62
00:04:44,930 --> 00:04:48,060
Well, one knee. And

63
00:04:48,060 --> 00:04:53,090
we should have called in advance to say that, but we didn't.

64
00:04:53,090 --> 00:05:01,240
And there was no way you were in a cast up past your knee to your thigh, like all the way down,  were walking with crutches

65
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:06,430
there was no way you were getting up to those seats and like no way getting down

66
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:08,030
and it's just a safety thing as well

67
00:05:08,030 --> 00:05:10,310
so they were not happy

68
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:21,120
but they finally just put us in to one of the handicap seats which ended up having an amazing view

69
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,470
we were very lucky

70
00:05:22,470 --> 00:05:23,640
i should have called ahead of time

71
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:26,370
but i just didn't even think about it at that time

72
00:05:26,370 --> 00:05:27,870
so...

73
00:05:27,870 --> 00:05:31,710
Yeah, we got good seats for them.

74
00:05:31,710 --> 00:05:35,520
